#: src/postulo/plugins/builtin_notifications/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Built-in notifications"
msgstr "Agebaut Notifikatiounen"

#: src/postulo/plugins/builtin_notifications/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "The ways Postulo can tell you, or a machine, that something happened without installing anything: a notification in your browser, an email, a signed message posted to an address. This is the switch for all three at once; each can still be switched off on its own while this is on. Switched off, none of them sends, and what was set up stays as it is."
msgstr "D'Weeër, wéi de Postulo Iech oder enger Maschinn soe kann, datt eppes geschitt ass, ouni eppes z'installéieren: eng Notifikatioun an Ärem Browser, eng E-Mail, e signéierte Message, deen un eng Adress geschéckt gëtt. Dëst ass de Schalter fir all dräi zesummen; jidderee kann nach eenzel ausgeschalt ginn, soulaang dësen un ass. Ausgeschalt schéckt keen vun hinnen eppes, an dat, wat ageriicht gouf, bleift, wéi et ass."
